<title>USA: MBIA qualifies Highland Village, Calif..</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies Highland Village, Calif..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp on Tuesday said that it qualified for insurance Highland Village, Calif.'s $4.09 million municipal bond issue, which will be sold competitively on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650)).</p>
